# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your own Supabase project's
# values (Project Settings -> API Keys in the Supabase dashboard). Both are
# safe to expose in the browser bundle — they only ever act within the Row
# Level Security policies defined in supabase/migrations/0001_init_schema.sql.
# Never put a service_role/secret key here or anywhere in the frontend.
#
# These are now REQUIRED, not optional: the app signs drivers in with a real
# Supabase Auth account (Register/Sign-in), so it can't run at all without a
# connected project. See the README's "Connecting a real database" section.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
